  "solution": {
    "text": "When springs are in series, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;<br /><br />For&nbsp; first&nbsp; spring, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mtext>m</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br />For&nbsp; Second&nbsp; spring, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mtext>m</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext>m</mtext><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><br />or&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mtext>m</mtext><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br />or&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>T</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></math> .",
